Hi,

We could not parse your subscription request. This usually happens if the #PICNIC block was modified, or if no valid journal or preprint IDs were found.

To subscribe or update your selection:

1. Visit paper-picnic.com/subscribe
2. Tick the journals and preprint categories you want
3. Click "Generate"
4. Copy the generated #PICNIC block exactly as shown
5. Paste it into a new email and send it to subscribe@paper-picnic.com

Do not modify the IDs inside the block. The human-readable names in parentheses are optional and are ignored by the parser.

To unsubscribe, email unsubscribe@paper-picnic.com from your subscribed address, or reply to any digest with the word "unsubscribe".

— Paper Picnic
